  "description": "<h3></h3>\n<h3>Description</h3>\n<p>Campsite, job site or even in the RV—the iconic style and rugged durability of this bottle means it’s made to go anywhere. The double-wall vacuum insulation keeps all your drinks at the ideal temperature and the twist-and-pour stopper allows for a smoother pour. The collapsible handle is made for easy grab-and-go and the insulated lid doubles as a cup for drinking.</p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Classic Series</li>\n<li>18/8 stainless steel, BPA-free</li>\n<li>Double-wall vacuum insulation</li>\n<li>Leakproof + packable</li>\n<li>Insulated lid doubles as cup</li>\n<li>Dishwasher safe</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Capacity: 1.4L</span></li>\n<li><span>Weight: 907g<br></span></li>\n<li><span>18/8 stainless steel</span></li>\n</ul>",
